# Built films. `films/<series>/*.json` is what `scripts/make-<series>.mjs`
# writes, and `films/physics/sfx/*.wav` is what `make-sfx.mjs` writes --
# both are build output, and the generators beside them are the source.
# The rendered MP4s are already covered by `out/` and `*.mp4` above.
films/
